---
// Header.astro — Floating Minimalist Header (Mix Blend Difference)
---

<header class="fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 p-6 md:p-12 flex justify-between items-start pointer-events-none mix-blend-difference text-white">
  
  <div class="pointer-events-auto">
    <a href="/" class="block font-extrabold text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-tighter hover:opacity-70 kh-transition leading-none">
      TK Flow
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="pointer-events-auto text-right">
    <span class="block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-1 opacity-70">
      Terminal Doradczy
    </span>
    <a href="tel:+48000000000" class="block font-bold text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-tighter hover:opacity-70 kh-transition">
      +48 000 000 000
    </a>
  </div>

</header>